Package: pager
Title: Save Tables and Plots as Word, HTML, or Text Documents
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Daniel D.", "Sjoberg", , "danield.sjoberg@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0862-2018")),
    person("Benoit", "Falquet", , "benoit.falquet@roche.com", role = "aut"),
    person("F. Hoffmann-La Roche AG", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: Save tables and plots as Word, HTML, or plain text documents
    via R Markdown. Tables of class 'gtsummary', 'gt', and 'flextable', as
    well as 'ggplot' and 'grob' plots, are supported. Lists of objects are
    rendered across multiple pages, making it straightforward to export
    paginated clinical reporting outputs.
